obs REDS FIRST -- the cold pass named two reds, both inherited. seed_link is the live subject of copal's own claim this hour. fold_shelf_link_repoint carried four depth-lost links my own shelved account added when the elder card text moved one directory down; those four are repointed by hand and the scan no longer names my file. The elder rows belong to peer-authored shelves and stay for a claimed lap rather than an unclaimed sweep.
obs ROSTER, NAMED HONESTLY RATHER THAN CLAIMED WHOLE. The cold endurance run was launched at lap open and stood at 126 of 273 lap-tier guards when this lap closed, two reds and the rest green; its tree_moved verdict was already fixed by the claim commit the ABSENCE stanza requires, which is the printed ordering fault incense claimed this hour. The hot proof is the intersecting guards run directly: falsifier_reach, rank_outcome, falsifier_verdict_home, two_rooms_doorway, ascii_document, prose_register, qa_report_card, index_row_bound, index_fold, room_bound, link_text_promise, mechanism_sentence, unshared_citation, exec_bit, dated_spelling, session_roster_agree, fold_shelf_link, and the new witness -- every one GREEN on metal. remember_git_nib read stale on the claim commit and is pinned in this work commit.
obs GRADED ON TOUCH -- the paper B+/89 with the judged truth half read, ITINERARY A+/100 at Meter, the elder falsifier page A/93. The paper's register began at 46 percent negative against Field's 30, which is what a page about an empty cell reads; seven sentences were flipped to what IS without losing a figure, and it stands at 36. The rest are load-bearing and stay.
scope one crossing instrument, one paper, one erratum, one roster row, one card account, four link targets in my own shelf
